    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Age - A simple and beautiful jigsaw puzzle game with the theme of the Stone Age. It describes the daily life of five beautiful and cute girls in the Stone Age, accompanied by relaxing music. After completing the level, you can enjoy the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has three levels of difficulty: 2x2, 2x4, 4x4 puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press &quot;F&quot; to turn on black and white when doing puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'Blank' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can quickly view girl pictures by pressing the AD key, left and right keys or the left and right keys of the mouse in the gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>",
